@base = http://localhost:3000/api/produits

### 1. GET liste → 200
GET {{base}}

### 2. GET un produit → 200
GET {{base}}/1

### 3. GET id inconnu → 404
GET {{base}}/999

### 4. GET id invalide → 400
GET {{base}}/abc

### 5. POST valide → 201 (doit créer l'id 4)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Écran",
  "prix": 399.99,
  "stock": 10,
  "categorie": "Informatique"
}

### 6. POST sans nom → 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prix": 25,
  "stock": 5,
  "categorie": "Accessoires"
}

### 7. POST prix négatif → 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Tapis",
  "prix": -10,
  "stock": 5,
  "categorie": "Accessoires"
}

### 8. POST stock décimal → 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Câble",
  "prix": 9.99,
  "stock": 2.5,
  "categorie": "Accessoires"
}

### 9. PUT valide → 200
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Laptop Pro",
  "prix": 1500,
  "stock": 3,
  "categorie": "Informatique"
}

### 10. PUT id inconnu → 404
PUT {{base}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Fantôme",
  "prix": 10,
  "stock": 1,
  "categorie": "Test"
}

### 11. PUT corps invalide → 400
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "   ",
  "prix": 0,
  "stock": -1,
  "categorie": ""
}

### 12. DELETE le produit créé au test 5 → 204
DELETE {{base}}/4

### 13. DELETE une deuxième fois → 404
DELETE {{base}}/4